{"key":"allod/ingos","relations":[{"id":"people","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/merc9","title":"Brissen","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/magess","title":"Diera","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/vor","title":"Flein der Kahle","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/mthief","title":"Gauner","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/ycf","title":"Graues Blatt","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/shopper","title":"Karansul","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/hero","title":"Kiran","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/deva","title":"Lu-a-Jalla","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc6","title":"Mairana","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/merc5","title":"Rinas","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/trapper","title":"Sver der Fallensteller","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/kapitan","title":"Tilvar","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/huber","title":"Valrasian","variant":""}],"title":"Bewohner"},{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/magess","title":"Diera","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/deva","title":"Lu-a-Jalla","variant":""}],"title":"Verbundene Figuren"},{"id":"region","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/gz11k","title":"Außenbezirke der Stadt","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz8k","title":"Ingos","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz13k","title":"Karansuls Einflussbereich","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz9k","title":"Lager des Grünen Clans","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz10k","title":"Neues Lager des Grünen Clans","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz14k","title":"Verbotene Minen","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/gz12k","title":"Verlassene Minen","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"map/bz11k","title":"Verlassene Minen","variant":""}],"title":"Orte"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Ingos</h1><h2>Schauplatz</h2><p>Ingos gehört zu Kania. Die dünn besiedelten Provinzen lassen unabhängigen Gemeinschaften und Waldleuten Raum. Statthalter und Stadtwache vertreten das Reich, doch die ursprüngliche Landeskunde betont den Eigensinn der Bewohner. Schneegebiete, Minen, Wälder und alte unterirdische Ruinen umgeben die Stadt. [1, 2, 3]</p><h2>Die Suche nach der Prinzessin</h2><p>Kiran kommt nach Ingos, um eine überlebende Joon zu finden. Hofintrigen, Karansuls Pläne und die Vertreibung des Grünen Klans erschweren die Suche. In den Minen findet er <a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Lu-a-Jalla</a>; <a href=\"wiki://character/magess\">Diera</a>’s Eifersucht erklärt ihr Verschwinden. Lu-a-Jallas Bericht führt Kiran anschließend nach Suslanger. [4, 5, 6]</p><h2>Quellen</h2><p>Grundlage sind die Originaldialoge und Weltbeschreibungen. Die Quellenzahlen verweisen auf die unten aufgeführten Szenen.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Quellen</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Ingos (allod ingos)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Außenbezirke der Stadt (zone gz11k)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Weltbeschreibung · Verlassene Minen (zone gz12k)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/rick\">Tka Rik (Tka-à-Lithan Richti-à-Nik)</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing r36)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Lu-a-Jalla</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a> (briefing d55)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialog · <a href=\"wiki://character/rick\">Tka Rik (Tka-à-Lithan Richti-à-Nik)</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Lu-a-Jalla</a> (briefing r54)</td></tr></table><h2>Bewohner</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc9\">Brissen</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/magess\">Diera</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/vor\">Flein der Kahle</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/mthief\">Gauner</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/ycf\">Graues Blatt</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/shopper\">Karansul</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kiran</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Lu-a-Jalla</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc6\">Mairana</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc5\">Rinas</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/trapper\">Sver der Fallensteller</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/kapitan\">Tilvar</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/huber\">Valrasian</a></td></tr></table><h2>Verbundene Figuren</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/magess\">Diera</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/deva\">Lu-a-Jalla</a></td></tr></table><h2>Orte</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Verwandte Seite</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz11k\">Außenbezirke der Stadt</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz8k\">Ingos</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz13k\">Karansuls Einflussbereich</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz9k\">Lager des Grünen Clans</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz10k\">Neues Lager des Grünen Clans</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz14k\">Verbotene Minen</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/gz12k\">Verlassene Minen</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/bz11k\">Verlassene Minen</a></td></tr></table></article>","id":"","image":"7af4b44382c4da798dfff32b","image_caption":"Originale Reisekarte","image_kind":"allod","pins":[],"representative_image":false,"title":"Ingos"}]}
